  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Heat of combustion : It is the amount of heat evolved or absorbed (i.e. change in enthalpy) when one mole of the substance is completely burnt in air or oxygen.</p><p>Standard enthalpy of combustion of glucose reaction is given as<br />​<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>6</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mrow> <mn>6</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>s</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </msub> <mo>+</mo> <mn>6</mn> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </msub> <mo>&#8594;</mo> <mn>6</mn> <msub> <mtext>CO</mtext> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </msub> <mo>+</mo> <mn>6</mn> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">l</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#916;</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>C</mtext> <mtext>o</mtext> </msubsup> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mi>&#931;</mi> <mtext>Product</mtext> </msub> <mo>&#916;</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>f</mtext> <mtext>o</mtext> </msubsup> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mi>&#931;</mi> <mtext>Reactant</mtext> </msub> <mo>&#916;</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>f</mtext> <mtext>o</mtext> </msubsup> </mrow> </math><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>6</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>+</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mtext>Product</mtext> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mtext>Reactant</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mtext>2900 kJ mole</mtext><mn>-1</mn></msup></math><br />Molecular mass of glucose <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>7</mn> <mn>2</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>9</mn> <mn>6</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>180 g</mtext> <mo>/</mo> <mtext>mole</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#916;</mo> <msubsup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>C</mtext> <mtext>o</mtext> </msubsup> <mo>/</mo> <mtext>gram of glucose</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>9</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>8</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>16.11 kJ</mtext> <mo>/</mo> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </math>.</p>",
